---
name: fix-complete
version: 1.0.0
description: Developer completion report for a fix-task; the body of `atm task close <task-id> completed`.
format: markdown
required_variables:
  - generated_at
  - task_id
  - phase
  - branch
  - commit
  - findings_fixed
  - findings_not_reproducible
  - findings_md
  - validation_md
optional_variables:
  - sprint_id
  - pr_number
  - notes_md
defaults:
  sprint_id: ""
  pr_number: ""
  notes_md: ""
metadata:
  type: fix-complete
  tags:
    - stage:fix
  workflow:
    scope:
      kind: phase
      variable: phase
    state: fix-complete
    stage: fix
    transition: complete
---
# Fix Complete

Generated: {{ generated_at }}
Phase/Task: {{ phase }} / {{ task_id }}
Branch: `{{ branch }}`
Commit: `{{ commit }}`
PR: {{ ('#' ~ pr_number) if pr_number else 'not opened' }}
Findings: {{ findings_fixed }} fixed, {{ findings_not_reproducible }} not reproducible

## Machine Status (JSON)
```json
{
  "phase": {{ phase | tojson }},
  "sprint": {{ sprint_id | tojson }},
  "task": {{ task_id | tojson }},
  "branch": {{ branch | tojson }},
  "commit": {{ commit | tojson }},
  "pr": {{ pr_number if pr_number else "null" }},
  "findings": {
    "fixed": {{ findings_fixed }},
    "not_reproducible": {{ findings_not_reproducible }}
  }
}
```

## Findings
{{ findings_md }}

## Validation
{{ validation_md }}
{% if notes_md %}
## Notes
{{ notes_md }}
{% endif %}
